id: class-up-berserker
name: Berserker
order: 3
optionOf: class-up-class-selection
optionEffect: 2
description: >
  Increase your Wound Rolls and Might by 1(T).
text: >
  Berserker [Passive]: Increase your Wound Rolls and Might by 1(T).
  • Berserker [1/Encounter]: Use the Basic Attack Maneuver or Signature Technique Maneuver as an Instant Maneuver. If you do, apply an Energy Charge to that Attacking Maneuver.

---

[passive, effect 2]
wound += 1(T);
might += 1(T);

# (3) Its Choice effect - an Instant once an Encounter, its own Maneuver (maneuvers/).
[passive, effect 3]
allow maneuver.class-up-berserker-choice;
